verticals and how it applies.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:51.870
But these ideas is that
the connected version

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:56.280
of all these businesses are all
actually relatively similar.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.515
They all follow the theme of
saying what information do

00:21:59.515 --> 00:22:00.765
we have in these environments?

00:22:00.765 --> 00:22:02.650
Remember that
instrumentation phase.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.930
How do we instrument
these businesses?

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:06.534
What are the key
things that people

00:22:06.534 --> 00:22:07.950
wish they knew,
or wish they could

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:11.470
tweak as performance attributes
that they have never had access

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:11.970
to?

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.610
And how does the
connection on proliferation

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:17.190
of devices that are
connected to the cloud

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:21.300
enable us to actually
measure and improve

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:23.970
those things, where we were
never able to do that before?

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:26.190
And not only are we
able to do it now,

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:28.260
but do it in a very
quick and rapid fashion

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:32.654
that allows for iteration and
rapid business value delivery.

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:39.970
So a few examples here, and I'll
go through them quite quickly,

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:43.880
Coca-Cola is actually
thinking about putting,

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:46.912
and actually is putting
connected end caps.

00:22:46.912 --> 00:22:49.120
Basically, those things at
the end of the supermarket

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:52.090
aisle where you go there
and it has some Coke bottles

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:52.600
and things.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:54.250
The smart connected
versions of those

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:56.050
rolling out to
stores nationwide.

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:58.660
Where there's a smart screen
combined with smart sensors

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:03.231
and beaconing to actually have
customers go and say wow, yeah,

00:23:03.231 --> 00:23:04.980
you know what, I want
to engage with this,

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:05.890
I want to look at
this stuff, I will

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:08.223
help make a selection from
what product they want to do.

00:23:08.223 --> 00:23:10.870
And we're seeing that
not only does that

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:13.090
improve Coke sales,
that actually

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:17.230
improves overall beverage
sales in that particular store.

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:19.780
Not just from the ones from
that particular end cap.

00:23:19.780 --> 00:23:22.290
Rentokil has an example
of coming up pretty soon,

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:25.360
